# Storybook

Every component under `src/components/**` and `src/features/*/components/**` has a sibling `*.stories.tsx`. shadcn primitives in `src/components/ui` included.

Write CSF3 stories: `satisfies Meta<typeof Component>`, `tags: ['autodocs']`, a `title` that follows the folder path (`Layout/UserMenu`), and one story per meaningful state. Use `fn()` for callbacks and a `play` function for interactions.

```tsx
const meta = {
  title: 'Auth/LoginForm',
  component: LoginForm,
  tags: ['autodocs'],
} satisfies Meta<typeof LoginForm>
```

`@storybook/tanstack-react` wraps every story in a router and mocks `createServerFn`, so do not add a `RouterProvider`. A `*.server.ts` module that a story reaches gets a `__mocks__` file registered with `sb.mock` in `.storybook/preview.tsx`. Reset any Zustand store the story touches in `beforeEach` with `useXStore.setState(...)`.

Share Storybook links with `&full=true` appended.
